{
  "_meta": {
    "schema_version": 1,
    "purpose": "Barangay hotline directory used to alert the BDRRMC/BPSO of the barangay an incident falls in (MOD-17 / MOD-34).",
    "source": {
      "type": "facebook-poster",
      "title": "Designated Evacuation Areas with Hotline Numbers, Municipality of Bocaue",
      "posted": "2026-08-29",
      "verified_by_mdrrmo": false
    },
    "notes": [
      "Numbers are transcribed from a public poster and are UNVERIFIED. Do not enable real barangay alerts until MDRRMO confirms them (see barangay-contact-confirmation.md).",
      "evacuation_areas[].coordinates are display hints only and are mostly wrong (9 of 33 fall in the right barangay). Never use them for routing; the barangay of an incident comes from the OpenStreetMap boundaries.",
      "kind=INVALID contacts are kept for the record and skipped by the seed. Do not guess a correction: ask the barangay.",
      "Roles are provisional: the first two mobile numbers are PRIMARY and BACKUP until MDRRMO picks them.",
      "A barangay with demo_override=true is TEMPORARY test data and must be restored from original_contacts before real use. The seed refuses to run in production while any demo contact is present."
    ],
    "barangay_id_spelling": "Names follow OpenStreetMap (Bundukan, Tambubong). poster_name keeps the poster spelling where it differs."
  },
